{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harness the power of symbols sealed in scrolls of mystic arts to defeat the monster!</strong><br>Spin your scroll and use the symbols that appear to strike down monsters. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792460/extras/84fd0cd92f3d49da1a68d14f6a249784.poster.avif?t=1764145394\" width=1170 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792460/extras/84fd0cd92f3d49da1a68d14f6a249784.webm?t=1764145394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792460/extras/84fd0cd92f3d49da1a68d14f6a249784.mp4?t=1764145394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat monster\u00a0and collect symbol fragments to create your own custom scroll!</strong><br>By defeating monster, you\u2019ll earn symbol fragments that can be used to enhance your scroll.<br>Carefully consider the combination of symbols you have, and strategically place them based on their synergy and scroll type.\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792460/extras/ab4b6b2bc8afabcf4e7796a57f5527e9.poster.avif?t=1764145394\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792460/extras/ab4b6b2bc8afabcf4e7796a57f5527e9.webm?t=1764145394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792460/extras/ab4b6b2bc8afabcf4e7796a57f5527e9.mp4?t=1764145394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your symbols and unlock powerful new abilities!</strong><br>Use the money you earn during your journey to strengthen symbols and grant them unique effects.<br>Each symbol can be enhanced to unleash different powers through upgrades.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792460/extras/b26fd31a14d6ef71547b40e3487d6c5b.poster.avif?t=1764145394\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792460/extras/b26fd31a14d6ef71547b40e3487d6c5b.webm?t=1764145394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792460/extras/b26fd31a14d6ef71547b40e3487d6c5b.mp4?t=1764145394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your scroll with parts dropped by monster and unlock new abilities!</strong><br>Some monster drop special scroll components when defeated.<br>By using these parts, you can restore a portion of your scroll\u2019s original power.<br>Gain access to unique abilities\u2014such as symbol placement, combat enhancements, or reuse mechanics\u2014and expand your tactical options.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792460/extras/ae33736f1c7a1e1a22dac050c6250f5a.poster.avif?t=1764145394\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792460/extras/ae33736f1c7a1e1a22dac050c6250f5a.webm?t=1764145394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792460/extras/ae33736f1c7a1e1a22dac050c6250f5a.mp4?t=1764145394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat the mighty lords of each domain!</strong><br>Each map features a dominant monster\u2014the lord of the area\u2014who poses a serious threat to the protagonist.<br>These powerful foes boast higher stats and unique abilities compared to regular enemies.<br>Overcome them to earn special rewards and build an even more powerful scroll!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792460/extras/269e3af206221ee441c4e815e46bb8ac.poster.avif?t=1764145394\" width=994 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792460/extras/269e3af206221ee441c4e815e46bb8ac.webm?t=1764145394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792460/extras/269e3af206221ee441c4e815e46bb8ac.mp4?t=1764145394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The scroll (slot machine) featured in this game is a magical tool that allows the use of mystical arts. It has no connection whatsoever to real money, gambling, or any form of actual currency, and does not require any payments to use!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3792460?t=1764145394","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792460/274c9858a3130d3410260a2155242b5255f8605f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764145394","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792460/ed49e5ea948216ffde0a995dcbd82af38c85e7f3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764145394","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792460/ed49e5ea948216ffde0a995dcbd82af38c85e7f3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764145394","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62